{"id":"2b98f8844a547104","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modal-assumption-derivability.md","title":"GL derivability from assumptions","display":"df-modal-assumption-derivability — GL derivability from assumptions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability","aliases":["72-df-modal-assumption-derivability"],"display":"df-modal-assumption-derivability — GL derivability from assumptions","depends_on":["[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, section 2, paragraph before Proposition 2.1, printed p. 477, PDF p. 489","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"source convention checked; local finite-stage closure checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modal-assumption-derivability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-assumption-derivability — GL derivability from assumptions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, section 2, paragraph before Proposition 2.1, printed p. 477, PDF p. 489"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source convention checked; local finite-stage closure checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a> 的公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_m\">\\(\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>、定理集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GL}\">\\(\\mathsf{GL}\\)</span> 及对象语言构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 表示集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的所有有限子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是临时假设集合。下式引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n(\\Gamma)\">\\(D_n(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 和逐元素方框像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\">\\(\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_0(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{GL}\\cup\\Gamma,\\qquad\nD_{n+1}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq D_n(\\Gamma)\\cup\n\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in D_n(\\Gamma)\\;(A\\to_m B)\\in D_n(\\Gamma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_0(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{GL}\\cup\\Gamma,\\qquad\nD_{n+1}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq D_n(\\Gamma)\\cup\n\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in D_n(\\Gamma)\\;(A\\to_m B)\\in D_n(\\Gamma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad A\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n(\\Gamma),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Gamma)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\neg(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bot_m),\\qquad\n\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m B:B\\in\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad A\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n(\\Gamma),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Gamma)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\neg(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bot_m),\\qquad\n\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m B:B\\in\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的带假设推导只允许从逻辑定理和临时假设使用 modus ponens；必然化已用于生成定理集，但不能直接作用于临时假设。此区别是演绎定理成立的前提。有限阶段并给出最小的 MP 闭包，每次成员资格均有有限推导；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\">\\(\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\)</span> 与无前缀的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\)</span> 等价，因为上游定理集本身 MP 闭合。这里的一致性是模态句法一致性，不是算术内部的 Con(T) 句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]] 的公式集 $\\mathcal F_m$、定理集 $\\mathsf{GL}$ 及对象语言构造子；$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"[X]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"D_n(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m[\\Gamma]","display":false},{"tex":"D_0(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{GL}\\cup\\Gamma,\\qquad\nD_{n+1}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq D_n(\\Gamma)\\cup\n\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in D_n(\\Gamma)\\;(A\\to_m B)\\in D_n(\\Gamma)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad A\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n(\\Gamma),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Gamma)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\neg(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bot_m),\\qquad\n\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m B:B\\in\\Gamma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A","display":false}],"bytes":2187,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability|df-modal-assumption-derivability — GL derivability from assumptions]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-modal-assumption-derivability — GL derivability from assumptions](72-df-modal-assumption-derivability.md)"},{"id":"a84520417d5eb9a3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]] 的 $\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 和 [[72-df-modal-adequate-set]] 的 $\\operatorname{Adeq}_m$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"c